# The runtime dependencies, by hand. requirements.txt is generated from this
# file and pins every package, transitive ones included:
#
#   pip-compile --strip-extras requirements.in
#
# Pinned because nothing here was. Every run installed whatever was newest
# that morning, so a Playwright release — which brings its own Chromium —
# could move the layout proof.py measures with no commit in this repo to
# explain it. Dependabot (.github/dependabot.yml) proposes the bumps as PRs,
# and check.yml renders and proofs the fixture on each before it is merged.
